cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Observed bus departure lateness, MiWay (Mississauga, Canada),
  August–October 2026
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Lin
    given-names: Ethan
# doi is the CONCEPT DOI on purpose: it always resolves to the newest
# version. Per-version: v1.0.0 = 10.5281/zenodo.22820449 (2026-09-17),
# v1.1.0 = 10.5281/zenodo.23444830 (2026-10-18).
version: 1.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22820448
date-released: "2026-10-18"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Dataset of 250,000 observed bus departures (with the complete
  8,031,942-row corpus included as a companion file) recorded from the
  GTFS-RT TripUpdate feed of MiWay, the municipal transit agency of
  Mississauga, Ontario, Canada. Each row is one scheduled bus departure at
  one stop with its observed deviation from schedule in minutes
  (negative = early). Seed-pinned sample and full provenance chain make
  every figure regenerable.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tapl1338/miway-findings"
keywords:
  - public transit
  - bus punctuality
  - GTFS-RT
  - real-time feed
  - departure delay
  - Mississauga
